{"dur": 24.9, "fps": 30, "segments": [{"id": "hook", "text": "Hier, tu as perdu trois heures de ta vie.", "t0": 1.2, "t1": 3.638, "words": [{"w": "Hier,", "t": 1.2}, {"w": "tu", "t": 1.505}, {"w": "as", "t": 1.688}, {"w": "perdu", "t": 1.87}, {"w": "trois", "t": 2.236}, {"w": "heures", "t": 2.602}, {"w": "de", "t": 3.029}, {"w": "ta", "t": 3.211}, {"w": "vie.", "t": 3.394}]}, {"id": "suspense", "text": "Et tu ne t'en es même pas rendu compte…", "t0": 4.388, "t1": 6.631, "words": [{"w": "Et", "t": 4.388}, {"w": "tu", "t": 4.538}, {"w": "ne", "t": 4.687}, {"w": "t'en", "t": 4.837}, {"w": "es", "t": 5.086}, {"w": "même", "t": 5.235}, {"w": "pas", "t": 5.485}, {"w": "rendu", "t": 5.684}, {"w": "compte…", "t": 5.983}]}, {"id": "reveal", "text": "Trois heures à dessiner des barres, des cadres et des cotes. À la main.", "t0": 7.011, "t1": 10.87, "words": [{"w": "Trois", "t": 7.011}, {"w": "heures", "t": 7.346}, {"w": "à", "t": 7.738}, {"w": "dessiner", "t": 7.85}, {"w": "des", "t": 8.353}, {"w": "barres,", "t": 8.577}, {"w": "des", "t": 8.968}, {"w": "cadres", "t": 9.192}, {"w": "et", "t": 9.584}, {"w": "des", "t": 9.751}, {"w": "cotes.", "t": 9.975}, {"w": "À", "t": 10.311}, {"w": "la", "t": 10.423}, {"w": "main.", "t": 10.59}]}, {"id": "chiffre", "text": "Sur une année, ça fait plus de trente journées de travail. Perdues.", "t0": 11.25, "t1": 14.982, "words": [{"w": "Sur", "t": 11.25}, {"w": "une", "t": 11.48}, {"w": "année,", "t": 11.709}, {"w": "ça", "t": 12.054}, {"w": "fait", "t": 12.226}, {"w": "plus", "t": 12.513}, {"w": "de", "t": 12.8}, {"w": "trente", "t": 12.972}, {"w": "journées", "t": 13.374}, {"w": "de", "t": 13.891}, {"w": "travail.", "t": 14.063}, {"w": "Perdues.", "t": 14.522}]}, {"id": "civrebar", "text": "CivRebar AI fait ce travail dans AutoCAD… en quelques secondes.", "t0": 15.362, "t1": 19.436, "words": [{"w": "CivRebar", "t": 15.362}, {"w": "AI", "t": 15.901}, {"w": "fait", "t": 16.081}, {"w": "ce", "t": 16.38}, {"w": "travail", "t": 16.56}, {"w": "